{"kind": "mod", "id": 785, "name": "Better Icons for mapgenie.io Tarkov Maps", "slug": "better-icons-for-mapgenieio-tarkov-maps", "teaser": "Browser-based \"mod\" for external mapgenie.io Tarkov maps website. Colorful, rarity-based icons for much better clarity.", "owner_name": "ODT", "downloads": 3509, "favourites": 1, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/1055.png", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:44.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-03-04T17:21:06.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-03-04T17:21:06.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "1.3.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>This “mod” uses an open-source extension <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/kylepaulsen/ResourceOverride\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Resource Override</a> to swap <strong>markers.png</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://mapgenie.io/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Mapgenie.io</a> uses for it’s <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://mapgenie.io/tarkov\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tarkov maps</a> for a custom one hosted on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/odt1/Mapgenie.io-Tarkov-Better-Icons\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">github repository</a>. Works with any <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/resource-override/pkoacgokdfckfpndoffpifphamojphii\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Chrome-based browser</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/resourceoverride/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Firefox</a>!</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/odt1/Mapgenie.io-Tarkov-Better-Icons/main/examples/chrome_FDqwj2eg3G.png\" alt=\"chrome_FDqwj2eg3G.png\" /></p>\n<p>More examples below:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/odt1/Mapgenie.io-Tarkov-Better-Icons/main/examples/chrome_fvOTQ2Ul5P.png\" alt=\"chrome_fvOTQ2Ul5P.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/odt1/Mapgenie.io-Tarkov-Better-Icons/main/examples/chrome_gEYdFKdDS3.png\" alt=\"chrome_gEYdFKdDS3.png\" /></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/odt1/Mapgenie.io-Tarkov-Better-Icons/main/examples/chrome_bG0DsClYSy.jpg\" alt=\"chrome_bG0DsClYSy.jpg\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Installation:</strong></p>\n<p>1) Install Resource Override from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/resource-override/pkoacgokdfckfpndoffpifphamojphii\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Chrome webstore</a> or <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://addons.mozilla.org/en-US/firefox/addon/resourceoverride/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Firefox page</a> (or manually from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/kylepaulsen/ResourceOverride\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kyle Paulsen’s GitHub</a>).</p>\n<p>2) Download the mod release archive and unpack it.</p>\n<p>3) Inside you will see <strong>resource_override_rules.json</strong> files.</p>\n<p>4) In Chrome, right to the address bar, click on puzzle icon, that opens extensions menu, then click on Resource Override to open its settings.</p>\n<p>5) On the right, you will see Options button, click on it, and after that Load Rules and target my <strong>resource_override_rules.json</strong>file.</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zryUCqG.png\" alt=\"zryUCqG.png\" /></p>\n<p><strong>Notes:</strong></p>\n<p>On my github page I left all the .psd files I used to create this icon pack, feel free to experiment with them yourself.</p>\n<p>---</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/odt1/Awesome-SPT\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Awesome SPT</a> - A personal collection/modlist/catalogue for (subjectively) best SPT mods.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 708, "published_at": "2025-01-29T13:10:06.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/785/better-icons-for-mapgenieio-tarkov-maps/1.3.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["odt1/Mapgenie.io-Tarkov-Better-Icons"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/odt1/Mapgenie.io-Tarkov-Better-Icons", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": false, "obtainable": true, "dep_problems": 0}